 or their  own experts but that's a real stretch  as has been a case of with this case  there are more questions than answers we  learned also this week that a judge  sealed the search warrant for Brian  coburger's apartment citing public  safety concerns and saying that the  details could prematurely end the  investigation we of course asked Ricky  Clement about this she says without  those details we won't know why but it  could have been done to preserve  evidence and protect Witnesses Gail yeah  Lilia the more you hear on this case the  more you want to know it's just still so  heartbreaking thank you
 

